@startuml
!include ../../common/style.puml
title Idempotency record life cycle (BaseIdempotencyStore)
[*] --> ABSENT
ABSENT --> IN_PROGRESS : claim() atomic\n→ CLAIMED
IN_PROGRESS --> SUCCEEDED : complete(result)\nowner-checked
IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED_RETRYABLE : fail(retryable=True)\nexception / conflict / dehydration
IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED_FINAL : fail(retryable=False)\ndeterministic error
IN_PROGRESS --> UNKNOWN : fail(retryable=False,\noutcome=UNKNOWN)
IN_PROGRESS --> RECOVERY : lease expired
FAILED_RETRYABLE --> IN_PROGRESS : claim() → CLAIMED
UNKNOWN --> RECOVERY
RECOVERY --> IN_PROGRESS : claim(recover=True)\nreconciler only
SUCCEEDED --> SUCCEEDED : claim() → REPLAY
FAILED_FINAL --> FAILED_FINAL : claim() → FAILED_FINAL
state RECOVERY : claim() → RECOVERY_REQUIRED
state IN_PROGRESS : claim() by other owner → IN_PROGRESS\nsame key + other fingerprint → CONFLICT
SUCCEEDED --> [*] : TTL garbage collection
FAILED_FINAL --> [*] : TTL garbage collection
@enduml
